<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<CustomMetadata xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" fqn="CustomDetector__mdt.ARM_025">
    <label>ARM-025</label>
    <protected>false</protected>
    <values><field>DetectorId__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">ARM-025</value></values>
    <values><field>Label__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Required attribute without default value</value></values>
    <values><field>Category__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">governance</value></values>
    <values><field>AppliesTo__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">ARM</value></values>
    <values><field>SoqlQuery__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">SELECT Id, Name FROM AttributeDefinition WHERE IsActive = true AND IsRequired = true AND (DefaultValue = null OR DefaultValue = '')</value></values>
    <values><field>TitleTemplate__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Required attribute &quot;{Name}&quot; has no default value</value></values>
    <values><field>DescriptionTemplate__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Required attributes should have a default to avoid blocking sales reps at quote time.</value></values>
    <values><field>PrimaryRecordIdField__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Id</value></values>
    <values><field>PrimaryRecordType__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">AttributeDefinition</value></values>
    <values><field>EntitledUsdField__c</field><value xsi:nil="true"/></values>
    <values><field>RealizedUsdField__c</field><value xsi:nil="true"/></values>
    <values><field>IsActive__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:boolean">true</value></values>
    <values><field>Version__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:double">1</value></values>
    <values><field>Effort__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">low</value></values>
    <values><field>RecoverabilityScore__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:double">0.9</value></values>
    <values><field>Severity__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Warning</value></values>
    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active AttributeDefinition records where IsRequired = true but DefaultValue is null or blank.
Why it matters: Reps hit a required field with no prefill — they guess, look up, or skip. Quote velocity slows and data quality degrades because reps make up values to get past the block.
Suppress a finding: when the field is genuinely customer-specific and no default exists.
Disable the detector: only when required-without-default is intentional. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
</CustomMetadata>
